window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>She’s the rich party girl. He’s her brother’s wild, adrenaline junkie best friend.</b></p> <p>Avery's had her eye on her brother’s best friend for years. But when she finally gives in to her attraction to Henry, what was meant to be a fling might just turn into something more.</p> <p>Now, Avery and Henry's infamous back and forth might just pull them into uncharted territory... falling in love.</p> <p><i>This standalone romance is a \"brother's best friend,\" \"best friend's little sister\" romance in the Meet Me at Midnight world.</i></p>"; 
